{"title":"Categoria:Priority translation","sourceTitle":"Category:Priority translation/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Category:Priority_translation\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Category:Priority translation (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Priority_translation/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Categoría:Traducción prioritaria (100% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Priority_translation/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Catégorie:Traduction prioritaire (100% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Priority_translation/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Категория:Приоритетный перевод (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Priority_translation/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Category:优先翻译页面 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Priority_translation/zh-cn\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"分类:优先翻译 (67% translated)\" lang=\"zh-Hans-CN\" dir=\"ltr\">中文（中国大陆）</a></li></ul></div>\n<p>Esta é uma lista de páginas consideradas boas candidatas para tradução. <b>Por favor leia o <a href=\"/index.php?title=Vintage_Story_Wiki:Como_traduzir_o_wiki&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Vintage Story Wiki:Como traduzir o wiki (page does not exist)\">guia de tradução</a></b> antes de trabalhar neles.\n</p><p><span id=\"Criteria\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Crit.C3.A9rios\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Critérios\">Critérios</span></h2>\n<p>As páginas devem ser:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Razoavelmente completo até a versão estável atual do Vintage Story</li>\n<li>Não contém nenhum modelo em andamento, como <a href=\"/Template:Stub\" title=\"Template:Stub\">Template:Stub</a> ou <a href=\"/index.php?title=Template:Em_constru%C3%A7%C3%A3o&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Em construção (page does not exist)\">Template:Em construção</a></li>\n<li>Ser marcado de forma precisa e adequada para tradução, incluindo a exclusão de navboxes, usando os modelos de localização apropriados e seguindo as práticas recomendadas para marcação de tradução</li>\n<li>Seja bem escrito e livre de erros gramaticais ou ortográficos importantes</li></ul>\n<p>Se a página puder sofrer uma revisão significativa no futuro, ela não deverá ser incluída nesta categoria.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120942\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1529/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:180908-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111120942 and revision id 393192. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Critérios","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"Category:Priority_translation/pt-br","byteoffset":225,"anchor":"Critérios","linkAnchor":"Critérios"}],"revid":393192,"so